# Unit25
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit25核心词汇

medium/ˈmiːdiəm/中等的；媒介/He is of medium height.
meet/miːt/遇见/We will meet at the school gate.
melt/melt/融化/The ice melted in the sun.
member/ˈmembər/成员/She is a member of the committee.
memoir/ˈmemwɑːr/回忆录/He published a memoir about his childhood.
memory/ˈmeməri/记忆/She has a good memory for names.
mental/ˈmentl/精神的/Mental health is as important as physical health.
mention/ˈmenʃn/提到/He mentioned the plan during the meeting.
merchant/ˈmɜːrtʃənt/商人/The merchant sells goods from all over the world.
mercy/ˈmɜːrsi/仁慈/The judge showed mercy to the young offender.
mere/mɪr/仅仅的/He is a mere child; don't blame him.
merely/ˈmɪrli/仅仅/It is merely a suggestion, not a requirement.
merit/ˈmerɪt/优点；功绩/She was promoted on her own merits.
message/ˈmesɪdʒ/信息/I left a message for you this morning.
method/ˈmeθəd/方法/This is an effective method of learning.
middle/ˈmɪdl/中间/The school is in the middle of the town.
might/maɪt/可能/It might rain later today.
mild/maɪld/温和的/The weather is mild in spring.
military/ˈmɪlɪteri/军事的/He served in the military for ten years.
million/ˈmɪljən/百万/The city has a population of three million.
mind/maɪnd/介意；头脑/Do you mind if I open the window?
mine/maɪn/矿；我的/This book is mine.
mineral/ˈmɪnərəl/矿物/The region is rich in mineral resources.
minimum/ˈmɪnɪməm/最小值/The minimum age for voting is 18.
minister/ˈmɪnɪstər/部长；牧师/The prime minister gave a speech.
minor/ˈmaɪnər/较小的；次要的/This is a minor problem; don't worry.
minority/maɪˈnɔːrəti/少数/Only a minority of people opposed the plan.
miracle/ˈmɪrəkl/奇迹/It was a miracle that no one was hurt.
mirror/ˈmɪrər/镜子/She looked at herself in the mirror.
miss/mɪs/错过；想念/I miss my family very much.
mission/ˈmɪʃn/任务；使命/They completed the mission successfully.
mistake/mɪˈsteɪk/错误/Everyone makes mistakes sometimes.
mix/mɪks/混合/Mix the flour and sugar together.
mixture/ˈmɪkstʃər/混合物/The drink is a mixture of fruit juices.
model/ˈmɑːdl/模型；模特/She works as a fashion model.
moderate/ˈmɑːdərət/适度的/Do moderate exercise every day.
modern/ˈmɑːdərn/现代的/Modern technology has changed our lives.
modest/ˈmɑːdɪst/谦虚的/Despite her achievements, she remains modest.
moment/ˈmoʊmənt/时刻/Wait a moment, please.
money/ˈmʌni/钱/He saved a lot of money for the trip.
monitor/ˈmɑːnɪtər/监视器；监控/The nurse monitored the patient's condition.
month/mʌnθ/月/She goes home once a month.
mood/muːd/心情/She is in a good mood today.
moral/ˈmɔːrəl/道德的/He is a man of high moral standards.
more/mɔːr/更多的/I need more time to finish the work.
morning/ˈmɔːrnɪŋ/早上/She jogs every morning.
most/moʊst/最多的/Most students enjoy this class.
mother/ˈmʌðər/母亲/My mother is a teacher.
motion/ˈmoʊʃn/运动；动议/The motion was approved by the committee.
mountain/ˈmaʊntn/山/They climbed the mountain last weekend.
